*** OWLI / خانه‌گرم — V24 mobile UX patch ***

1) Hero:
- Add class `hero-slide-${HERO_INDEX+1}` to the active hero slide.
- On phones, make Hero slightly taller and give the right-side copy a stronger readable gradient.
- Reduce mobile title/body density and improve CTA/trust spacing.

2) Home product carousel:
- Hide side arrows on phones; keep swipe + dots.
- Show one substantially larger product card at a time instead of squeezing two cards together.
- Preserve the existing product images/content and desktop behavior.

Apply these CSS rules before </body> in index.html:

